    <string-array name="ub_police_tips">
        <item>Stay on the line. Tell the operator where you are first, then what is happening.</item>
        <item>If you can’t talk, keep the line open. Operators can still listen and trace the call.</item>
        <item>Move towards a well-lit, busy place such as a shop, ATM or petrol pump.</item>
        <item>Note landmarks around you: shop names, bus stops and vehicle numbers.</item>
        <item>Keep your phone charged and location on when travelling at night.</item>
        <item>Share your live location with someone you trust before a late ride.</item>
    </string-array>

